sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as Enterprise User
    participant FE as Enterprise Portal
    participant Chat as chat.Manager
    participant LLM as Orchestration LLM
    participant Engine as agent.Engine
    participant MCP as Internal MCP Tools
    participant Skill as skill_runner / external MCP
    participant Target as Target LLM
    participant Report as report.Generator

    User->>FE: Submit assessment request
    FE->>Chat: POST /api/v1/chat/sessions/:id/messages
    Chat->>LLM: Parse intent with state and constraints
    LLM-->>Chat: Structured action or recoverable prose plan
    Chat-->>FE: plan_confirm / launch_skill / normal reply

    User->>FE: Click confirm
    FE->>Chat: POST /api/v1/chat/sessions/:id/confirm
    Chat->>Chat: Validate target config and create assessment
    Chat-->>FE: Starting progress card

    Chat->>Engine: RunWithClient(...)
    Engine->>MCP: recommend_resources
    MCP-->>Engine: candidate resources and candidate skills
    Engine->>LLM: Optional resource-mode planning
    LLM-->>Engine: selected resource mode

    alt sample_template
        Engine->>MCP: preview_sample / preview_template
        Engine->>MCP: combine_template_sample
    else composed_attack
        Engine->>MCP: preview_composed_attack / load_composed_attack
    else sample_rewrite
        Engine->>MCP: preview_attack_sample
        Engine->>MCP: rewrite_attack_sample_with_ccbos
        MCP->>Skill: call external rewrite MCP
    else skill_generated
        Engine->>MCP: preview_skill
        Engine->>MCP: run_generator_skill
        MCP->>Skill: call skill_runner
    end

    Engine->>MCP: enhance_payloads if needed
    Engine->>MCP: execute_payloads
    MCP->>Target: run assessment batch
    Target-->>MCP: target responses
    MCP-->>Engine: execution results
    Engine->>Report: build report
    Report-->>Chat: summary / risk / safety score / attachments
    Chat-->>FE: Report card
